298
00:17:47,400 --> 00:17:51,359
and the empire.

299
00:17:52,259 --> 00:17:52,740
Understood.

300
00:17:54,839 --> 00:17:55,559
But if we don't,

301
00:17:55,559 --> 00:17:58,140
they're going to shoot

302
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:00,579
this place to pieces.

303
00:18:15,180 --> 00:18:15,740
Changxuan,

304
00:18:19,259 --> 00:18:19,900
it's done.

305
00:18:20,420 --> 00:18:21,779
Chairman Takahashi

306
00:18:21,900 --> 00:18:22,740
agrees to release Miss Ye.

307
00:18:22,900 --> 00:18:23,480
But

308
00:18:23,759 --> 00:18:24,839
he earnestly asks you

309
00:18:25,279 --> 00:18:26,460
to do them the honor of

310
00:18:26,859 --> 00:18:27,779
having a dinner to talk

311
00:18:27,900 --> 00:18:28,579
about the business.

312
00:19:26,019 --> 00:19:27,160
Yu Changxuan.

313
00:19:30,519 --> 00:19:32,019
You came.

314
00:19:42,779 --> 00:19:43,480
I'm here.

315
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:46,920
You're safe now.

316
00:20:16,059 --> 00:20:16,859
How is she?

317
00:20:17,420 --> 00:20:18,420
Is she all right?

318
00:20:43,319 --> 00:20:44,759
General!

319
00:21:32,799 --> 00:21:34,019
Training continues.

320
00:21:34,220 --> 00:21:34,859
Yes sir.

321
00:21:40,940 --> 00:21:42,519
Training continues.

322
00:21:42,720 --> 00:21:43,359
Yes sir.

323
00:22:01,980 --> 00:22:02,579
She's rescued.

324
00:22:02,880 --> 00:22:03,740
That's what matters.

325
00:22:28,000 --> 00:22:28,640
Drive slower.

326
00:22:29,460 --> 00:22:29,980
Yes sir.

327
00:22:37,079 --> 00:22:38,000
[Ye Pingjun.]

328
00:22:39,240 --> 00:22:40,160
[Why did you appear]

329
00:22:40,160 --> 00:22:41,259
[in my world again?]

330
00:22:57,359 --> 00:22:58,920
Yu Changxuan is really hard to kill.

331
00:22:59,180 --> 00:23:00,319
At the Battle of Luanjiang,

332
00:23:00,720 --> 00:23:02,039
his weapons were tampered with,

333
00:23:04,380 --> 00:23:05,779
and he still escaped with his life.

334
00:23:06,359 --> 00:23:07,880
More than escaping.

335
00:23:10,119 --> 00:23:11,980
He made his name in one battle

336
00:23:12,500 --> 00:23:13,819
and rose fast.

337
00:23:14,519 --> 00:23:15,680
But he's only just taken power.

338
00:23:16,480 --> 00:23:17,480
His foundation isn't stable.

339
00:23:18,119 --> 00:23:20,019
He sensed the existence of a mole in the army

340
00:23:20,720 --> 00:23:21,980
and is investigating hard.

341
00:23:22,380 --> 00:23:23,660
All senior officers,

342
00:23:24,460 --> 00:23:25,920
even me, his brother-in-law,

343
00:23:26,480 --> 00:23:27,519
he won't spare.

344
00:23:28,359 --> 00:23:29,279
During this time,

345
00:23:30,859 --> 00:23:32,559
let's not contact each other at all.

346
00:23:34,359 --> 00:23:34,819
I won't

347
00:23:34,819 --> 00:23:36,400
take any action either.

348
00:23:37,059 --> 00:23:37,420
Good.

349
00:23:38,720 --> 00:23:39,859
We'll do as you say.

350
00:23:42,559 --> 00:23:43,960
As long as you stay by his side,

351
00:23:44,720 --> 00:23:46,380
you'll find the right moment.

352
00:23:48,960 --> 00:23:50,380
After all, outside enemies can be stopped,

353
00:23:51,440 --> 00:23:52,440
inside enemies can't.

354
00:24:18,900 --> 00:24:20,319
Why are you up?

355
00:24:28,000 --> 00:24:29,259
I made some ginger soup.

356
00:24:29,480 --> 00:24:30,779
Drink it while it's hot.

357
00:24:32,059 --> 00:24:32,859
Okay.

358
00:24:36,319 --> 00:24:38,180
What exactly happened?

359
00:24:39,660 --> 00:24:41,059
Last night, Young Master Yu sent someone

360
00:24:41,059 --> 00:24:42,460
to bring you back.

361
00:24:42,920 --> 00:24:45,200
Said you got caught in the rain during performance.

362
00:24:45,519 --> 00:24:47,920
Nothing else would they say.

363
00:24:50,819 --> 00:24:52,019
I'm fine.

364
00:24:52,619 --> 00:24:54,200
Just a little mishap.

365
00:25:05,119 --> 00:25:05,920
Mom.

366
00:25:06,859 --> 00:25:08,000
I'm sorry

367
00:25:08,599 --> 00:25:10,019
to worry you.

368
00:25:16,019 --> 00:25:16,859
Pingjun.

369
00:25:18,000 --> 00:25:19,019
I know

370
00:25:20,140 --> 00:25:21,259
a barrier

371
00:25:21,660 --> 00:25:22,940
has stood between

372
00:25:23,180 --> 00:25:25,000
you and Xueting.

373
00:25:25,420 --> 00:25:26,759
I see it

374
00:25:27,380 --> 00:25:28,759
and worry about it,

375
00:25:29,099 --> 00:25:30,700
but I don't know

376
00:25:31,259 --> 00:25:33,359
how to help you resolve it.

377
00:25:34,920 --> 00:25:35,720
Mom.

378
00:25:37,200 --> 00:25:40,660
Xueting and I grew up together.

379
00:25:41,519 --> 00:25:43,259
He is a man of both

380
00:25:43,619 --> 00:25:45,000
integrity and ability.

381
00:25:45,519 --> 00:25:47,240
When I was little,

382
00:25:47,740 --> 00:25:48,920
I always felt that the two of us

383
00:25:49,319 --> 00:25:50,079
would surely

384
00:25:50,079 --> 00:25:51,720
be together.

385
00:25:53,119 --> 00:25:54,920
But now I've realized

386
00:25:55,660 --> 00:25:57,700
that it seems we've been apart

387
00:25:57,900 --> 00:25:59,859
for too long.

388
00:26:01,759 --> 00:26:02,859
We're no longer

389
00:26:02,859 --> 00:26:04,259
the people we were.

390
00:26:05,400 --> 00:26:06,779
Some things

391
00:26:07,940 --> 00:26:09,799
can't go back.

392
00:26:11,900 --> 00:26:12,740
Pingjun.

393
00:26:16,500 --> 00:26:18,339
What Young Master Yu did before

394
00:26:19,960 --> 00:26:21,059
was wrong.

395
00:26:22,220 --> 00:26:24,059
But I can see

396
00:26:25,420 --> 00:26:26,299
that he truly

397
00:26:27,079 --> 00:26:28,480
cares for you.

398
00:26:30,299 --> 00:26:32,200
What I want to tell you is

399
00:26:33,299 --> 00:26:34,900
love isn't habit.

400
00:26:37,319 --> 00:26:39,200
No one

401
00:26:39,700 --> 00:26:42,019
can make you choose someone.

402
00:26:44,460 --> 00:26:46,259
I just want you to know

403
00:26:48,039 --> 00:26:50,660
that you should follow your own heart.

404
00:27:09,579 --> 00:27:11,099
Speaking of choosing a house,

405
00:27:11,400 --> 00:27:12,460
my uncle's eye

406
00:27:12,460 --> 00:27:13,880
is the best.

407
00:27:14,779 --> 00:27:15,839
This Western-style building

408
00:27:15,839 --> 00:27:16,839
was designed by a famous

409
00:27:16,839 --> 00:27:18,200
French designer.

410
00:27:18,319 --> 00:27:19,920
My uncle bought it specially for us

411
00:27:19,920 --> 00:27:21,019
as a wedding gift.

412
00:27:22,400 --> 00:27:23,880
The flower hall outside

413
00:27:23,880 --> 00:27:25,220
even has hot spring water piped in.

414
00:27:25,559 --> 00:27:27,599
The flowers in the hall never fade.

415
00:27:28,440 --> 00:27:29,960
The annex building even has a banquet hall.

416
00:27:30,460 --> 00:27:31,359
I've already seen it.

417
00:27:31,599 --> 00:27:32,519
It's not small at all.

418
00:27:32,519 --> 00:27:33,099
Big enough

419
00:27:33,099 --> 00:27:34,559
to serve as a dance hall.

420
00:27:34,700 --> 00:27:36,299
It'll be very convenient

421
00:27:36,400 --> 00:27:37,099
to host friends.

422
00:27:37,700 --> 00:27:39,819
But I instructed

423
00:27:39,940 --> 00:27:41,059
that your study

424
00:27:41,099 --> 00:27:42,440
should still be in Chinese style.

425
00:27:42,920 --> 00:27:45,599
Open its window,

426
00:27:46,259 --> 00:27:48,000
and you can take in the beauty of the whole garden.

427
00:27:49,099 --> 00:27:50,819
Let me take you to see the garden.

428
00:27:52,500 --> 00:27:53,299
Ziyi.

429
00:28:01,380 --> 00:28:02,180
Sorry.

430
00:28:06,140 --> 00:28:07,900
What for?

431
00:28:08,240 --> 00:28:09,740
Don't tell me fighting a war

432
00:28:09,880 --> 00:28:10,660
got you a

433
00:28:10,660 --> 00:28:11,599
camp follower wife?

434
00:28:13,119 --> 00:28:14,599
I want to call off our engagement.

435
00:28:22,299 --> 00:28:23,240
I never imagined

436
00:28:24,880 --> 00:28:26,660
that coming to view the house

437
00:28:27,140 --> 00:28:28,799
would be the last flicker

438
00:28:29,059 --> 00:28:30,579
before our engagement

439
00:28:30,579 --> 00:28:32,059
dies out.

440
00:28:33,579 --> 00:28:35,359
You can't even wait to finish viewing?

441
00:28:36,299 --> 00:28:37,980
You won't give me

442
00:28:37,980 --> 00:28:39,299
even this tiny bit of patience?

443
00:28:41,019 --> 00:28:41,900
I don't want to deceive you,

444
00:28:43,400 --> 00:28:44,400
nor myself.

445
00:28:45,920 --> 00:28:46,920
For a long time,

446
00:28:47,400 --> 00:28:48,460
for the sake of power,

447
00:28:49,359 --> 00:28:50,559
I've worn a mask,

448
00:28:51,099 --> 00:28:52,180
deceiving everyone,

449
00:28:55,220 --> 00:28:56,259
including my family

450
00:28:57,279 --> 00:28:58,160
and myself.

451
00:29:00,220 --> 00:29:01,400
In front of rivals,

452
00:29:02,440 --> 00:29:04,059
I played the pleasure-seeking wastrel.

453
00:29:06,000 --> 00:29:07,200
In front of family,

454
00:29:08,940 --> 00:29:10,400
I played the spoiled rebel.

455
00:29:11,259 --> 00:29:12,420
In front of women,

456
00:29:13,180 --> 00:29:14,700
I played the tender lover.

457
00:29:16,119 --> 00:29:17,400
Everything could be used.

458
00:29:18,599 --> 00:29:19,299
And everything

459
00:29:20,019 --> 00:29:21,319
could be discarded.

460
00:29:23,900 --> 00:29:25,099
Including marriage.

461
00:29:27,119 --> 00:29:28,200
Including love.

462
00:29:30,819 --> 00:29:31,460
So all along,

463
00:29:33,279 --> 00:29:34,200
your wanting

464
00:29:34,200 --> 00:29:35,660
to marry me

465
00:29:37,099 --> 00:29:38,299
was fake.

466
00:29:39,900 --> 00:29:41,559
It was all weighing interests,

467
00:29:42,680 --> 00:29:43,480
right?

468
00:29:46,160 --> 00:29:46,660
Yes.

469
00:29:50,960 --> 00:29:52,660
You've been a perfect actor.

470
00:29:53,000 --> 00:29:54,160
Not a single crack.

471
00:29:54,619 --> 00:29:55,960
Impeccable.

472
00:29:56,819 --> 00:29:57,559
You could have

473
00:29:57,559 --> 00:29:58,660
kept acting like that,

474
00:29:59,119 --> 00:30:00,220
gotten the reputation

475
00:30:00,220 --> 00:30:01,420
and fame you wanted,

476
00:30:02,599 --> 00:30:03,960
satisfied your ambition.

477
00:30:05,680 --> 00:30:06,440
So why did you

478
00:30:06,440 --> 00:30:07,579
suddenly stop acting?

479
00:30:10,920 --> 00:30:12,200
On the battlefield,

480
00:30:12,819 --> 00:30:14,299
facing the death itself,

481
00:30:14,720 --> 00:30:15,660
I finally understood.

482
00:30:16,640 --> 00:30:18,119
I don't want to wear a mask

483
00:30:18,859 --> 00:30:19,519
for my whole life.

484
00:30:19,519 --> 00:30:20,740
Stop making these

485
00:30:20,740 --> 00:30:21,559
high-sounding excuses.

486
00:30:26,160 --> 00:30:26,880
Isn't it just because

487
00:30:26,880 --> 00:30:27,859
of that accident?

488
00:30:29,200 --> 00:30:30,920
Isn't it just that you fell for

489
00:30:30,920 --> 00:30:32,299
Ye Pingjun?

490
00:30:40,980 --> 00:30:41,779
Yes.

491
00:30:43,960 --> 00:30:44,839
I do like her.

492
00:30:47,359 --> 00:30:48,759
When I was on the edge of life and death,

493
00:30:50,099 --> 00:30:51,200
I was thinking

494
00:30:53,099 --> 00:30:54,519
that toward the girl I like,

495
00:30:55,500 --> 00:30:56,420
I had never,

496
00:30:57,480 --> 00:30:58,400
not even once,

497
00:30:59,200 --> 00:31:00,759
expressed my feelings.

498
00:31:07,000 --> 00:31:07,460
Ziyi.

499
00:31:08,900 --> 00:31:09,660
There are some places

500
00:31:11,079 --> 00:31:11,779
that once you've been,

501
00:31:12,240 --> 00:31:13,180
you can't come back.

502
00:31:14,420 --> 00:31:15,460
Like the battlefield.

503
00:31:16,599 --> 00:31:17,220
Like

504
00:31:18,579 --> 00:31:19,759
one's own heart.

505
00:31:26,059 --> 00:31:27,500
The Yu army's military funds

506
00:31:27,940 --> 00:31:29,519
need financial support.

507
00:31:30,660 --> 00:31:32,339
My family's money

508
00:31:32,960 --> 00:31:35,160
is necessary for your rise.

509
00:31:37,579 --> 00:31:38,900
For Ye Pingjun,

510
00:31:40,019 --> 00:31:42,059
you'd rather go against reason,

511
00:31:43,319 --> 00:31:44,680
harm your prospects,

512
00:31:45,019 --> 00:31:46,519
make enemies everywhere.

513
00:31:46,799 --> 00:31:48,140
And you don't care,

514
00:31:49,259 --> 00:31:50,059
right?

515
00:31:52,420 --> 00:31:53,759
Since I planned to tell you the truth,

516
00:31:54,559 --> 00:31:55,460
I've thought through

517
00:31:56,859 --> 00:31:57,980
all these consequences.

518
00:32:04,359 --> 00:32:05,240
For this,

519
00:32:06,400 --> 00:32:08,200
I'm sorry from the bottom of my heart.

520
00:32:09,400 --> 00:32:10,519
Of course I know

521
00:32:12,519 --> 00:32:13,700
no amount of apology

522
00:32:15,519 --> 00:32:16,700
can make up for it.

523
00:32:19,160 --> 00:32:20,460
When Mr. Tao returns,

524
00:32:21,319 --> 00:32:23,420
I will come to your door in person to apologize.

525
00:32:32,500 --> 00:32:33,440
Yu Changxuan.

526
00:32:35,019 --> 00:32:37,259
I can tell you plainly:

527
00:32:38,700 --> 00:32:40,140
even if you deceived me,

528
00:32:40,819 --> 00:32:41,859
even if you used me,

529
00:32:42,680 --> 00:32:44,519
I, Tao Ziyi, don't care.

530
00:32:45,319 --> 00:32:46,900
Between the two of us,

531
00:32:48,160 --> 00:32:49,799
it's just each taking what we need.

532
00:32:50,799 --> 00:32:52,460
You want my family's support.

533
00:32:52,640 --> 00:32:53,259
And I

534
00:32:53,259 --> 00:32:55,160
want the title of Mrs. Yu.

535
00:32:58,099 --> 00:32:59,119
I'll compromise.

536
00:33:01,160 --> 00:33:02,720
If you want her as a mistress,

537
00:33:03,420 --> 00:33:04,819
or even give her a title,

538
00:33:05,819 --> 00:33:07,220
make her a concubine,

539
00:33:08,000 --> 00:33:08,900
I agree.

540
00:33:10,900 --> 00:33:11,779
But I don't want to.

541
00:33:12,259 --> 00:33:12,880
You want to

542
00:33:12,880 --> 00:33:14,359
marry her properly?

543
00:33:17,519 --> 00:33:18,759
Wake up.

544
00:33:19,700 --> 00:33:21,059
She doesn't love you at all.

545
00:33:22,000 --> 00:33:23,160
Whether she loves me or not,

546
00:33:24,400 --> 00:33:25,420
I love her, and that's enough.

547
00:33:25,819 --> 00:33:26,380
But she's already

548
00:33:26,380 --> 00:33:27,880
about to marry Jiang Xueting.

549
00:33:28,400 --> 00:33:29,759
Even if she's going to marry someone else,

550
00:33:30,940 --> 00:33:32,519
I don't want to marry someone

551
00:33:33,599 --> 00:33:34,700
I don't love,

552
00:33:35,559 --> 00:33:37,099
using a false marriage

553
00:33:38,119 --> 00:33:39,039
to deceive you

554
00:33:40,579 --> 00:33:41,539
and deceive myself.

555
00:33:53,720 --> 00:33:54,660
Yu Changxuan.

556
00:33:56,799 --> 00:33:57,880
Do you know how ridiculous

557
00:33:57,880 --> 00:33:59,559
those words sound

558
00:34:00,960 --> 00:34:02,359
coming from your mouth?

559
00:34:05,559 --> 00:34:07,200
You bow and scrape,

560
00:34:07,940 --> 00:34:09,119
humble yourself begging for love.

561
00:34:10,900 --> 00:34:12,780
You've been heartless, loveless, calculating.

562
00:34:12,780 --> 00:34:14,639
Since when did you become a lovesick fool?

563
00:34:28,179 --> 00:34:28,980
I'm sorry.

564
00:35:22,960 --> 00:35:23,739
Miss,

565
00:35:24,119 --> 00:35:25,380
please have something.

566
00:35:25,960 --> 00:35:27,860
You haven't had a bite since last night.

567
00:35:37,300 --> 00:35:38,340
Miss.

568
00:35:38,860 --> 00:35:40,099
Your sister won't be back

569
00:35:40,099 --> 00:35:40,920
for days.

570
00:35:41,500 --> 00:35:43,000
And your father has gone to Tianjin.

571
00:35:43,260 --> 00:35:44,000
What am I

572
00:35:44,320 --> 00:35:45,900
supposed to do?

573
00:36:01,539 --> 00:36:02,480
Miss.

574
00:36:02,980 --> 00:36:05,139
If you want to eat, just call me.

575
00:36:35,880 --> 00:36:36,920
General Yu.

576
00:36:37,780 --> 00:36:39,920
I've prepared this humble banquet

577
00:36:40,239 --> 00:36:42,199
to thank you for doing me the honor.

578
00:36:42,539 --> 00:36:44,519
Truly an immense honor.

579
00:36:44,760 --> 00:36:46,179
Chairman Takahashi, your Chinese

580
00:36:47,119 --> 00:36:48,019
is quite good.

581
00:36:48,619 --> 00:36:50,619
From Northeast China to Tianjin,

582
00:36:50,639 --> 00:36:51,880
and then to Nanhuai,

583
00:36:52,340 --> 00:36:53,360
I've lived in this Country

584
00:36:53,500 --> 00:36:55,179
for sixteen years already.

585
00:36:55,659 --> 00:36:56,599
I have very deep feelings

586
00:36:56,900 --> 00:36:59,420
for this place.

587
00:37:01,920 --> 00:37:02,940
Although the chamber

588
00:37:03,820 --> 00:37:05,500
of commerce was only established

589
00:37:05,500 --> 00:37:07,199
in Nanhuai a short year ago,

590
00:37:07,619 --> 00:37:08,599
we have also received

591
00:37:08,599 --> 00:37:10,179
the protection of the Yu army.

592
00:37:10,539 --> 00:37:13,619
I express my deep gratitude.

593
00:37:13,960 --> 00:37:15,199
Regardless of nationality,

594
00:37:16,260 --> 00:37:17,599
as long as it's lawful and reasonable

595
00:37:17,599 --> 00:37:18,940
and legitimate business,

596
00:37:19,860 --> 00:37:21,159
it should be protected.

597
00:37:38,739 --> 00:37:39,500
Mr. Fujiwara Ko,

598
00:37:40,500 --> 00:37:41,480
you've come.

599
00:37:46,099 --> 00:37:46,920
General Yu.

600
00:37:47,420 --> 00:37:48,900
Allow me to introduce.

601
00:37:55,960 --> 00:37:58,699
This is Mr. Fujiwara Ko.

602
00:38:00,619 --> 00:38:03,059
General Yu, I've long heard of your name.

603
00:38:04,860 --> 00:38:05,900
Nice to meet you.

604
00:38:06,500 --> 00:38:07,400
You also hold a position

605
00:38:07,860 --> 00:38:09,579
in the Japanese Chamber of Commerce?

606
00:38:09,860 --> 00:38:11,900
His father

607
00:38:12,039 --> 00:38:15,760
was a founding elder of the Meiji government and a hereditary count.

608
00:38:16,219 --> 00:38:18,059
After Mr. Fujiwara inherited the title,

609
00:38:18,420 --> 00:38:19,519
he traveled through countries.

610
00:38:19,760 --> 00:38:21,239
He is especially fond of

611
00:38:21,239 --> 00:38:23,719
China's wondrous landscapes.

612
00:38:30,699 --> 00:38:32,260
After coming to Nanhuai,

613
00:38:33,500 --> 00:38:35,380
he found the commerce here thriving

614
00:38:35,820 --> 00:38:37,360
and well-ordered.

615
00:38:38,059 --> 00:38:38,659
I finally see

616
00:38:38,659 --> 00:38:40,639
your extraordinary bearing.

617
00:38:40,860 --> 00:38:41,900
You show your invincibility

618
00:38:42,219 --> 00:38:43,679
wherever your banners go.

619
00:38:43,980 --> 00:38:46,300
Truly admirable.

620
00:38:46,400 --> 00:38:47,679
You are too kind.

621
00:38:48,559 --> 00:38:49,380
I merely stand on

622
00:38:49,380 --> 00:38:50,719
the merits of my forebears,

623
00:38:51,320 --> 00:38:52,519
which is why I have opportunities.

624
00:38:53,719 --> 00:38:55,539
You are too modest.

625
00:38:56,360 --> 00:38:58,000
You probably know

626
00:38:58,500 --> 00:39:00,360
that several years ago,

627
00:39:00,820 --> 00:39:02,380
the Japanese Chamber of Commerce lent

628
00:39:02,380 --> 00:39:03,960
General Xu of the Cheng Army

629
00:39:04,199 --> 00:39:05,039
three million yen

630
00:39:05,039 --> 00:39:07,179
through the Bank of Korea.

631
00:39:08,000 --> 00:39:09,900
He used it all to buy weapons.

632
00:39:10,780 --> 00:39:12,579
Throughout the Sujing region,

633
00:39:13,300 --> 00:39:15,300
we think most highly

634
00:39:15,880 --> 00:39:17,059
of you.

635
00:39:18,000 --> 00:39:18,579
We are willing

636
00:39:18,579 --> 00:39:22,099
to offer you various favorable conditions.

637
00:39:33,219 --> 00:39:35,099
General Yu. Please.

638
00:40:03,400 --> 00:40:04,480
No matter what,

639
00:40:04,739 --> 00:40:06,360
to meet you today

640
00:40:06,420 --> 00:40:08,059
is a great honor.

641
00:40:10,300 --> 00:40:12,960
This is our family's medal.

642
00:40:13,900 --> 00:40:16,400
It is only given to our most precious friends.

643
00:40:29,599 --> 00:40:31,320
You have come from afar.

644
00:40:31,900 --> 00:40:33,000
As the host,

645
00:40:33,900 --> 00:40:35,519
it should be I who gives you a gift.

646
00:41:18,559 --> 00:41:20,920
Then I thank you

647
00:41:20,920 --> 00:41:22,099
for your kind intentions.

648
00:41:23,539 --> 00:41:24,519
No need for thanks.

649
00:41:45,699 --> 00:41:47,380
Go look into this Fujiwara Ko.

650
00:41:48,539 --> 00:41:49,480
He's probably not

651
00:41:49,480 --> 00:41:50,679
a Japanese nobleman simply

652
00:41:50,679 --> 00:41:51,539
for sightseeing.

653
00:41:52,900 --> 00:41:53,500
Yes sir.

654
00:42:03,659 --> 00:42:04,460
Chairman.

655
00:42:05,599 --> 00:42:07,199
We have received

656
00:42:07,199 --> 00:42:08,519
a gift from Yu Changxuan.

657
00:42:08,960 --> 00:42:11,519
We can put this news in tomorrow's papers.

658
00:42:12,000 --> 00:42:13,199
Proclaim his

659
00:42:13,199 --> 00:42:16,280
friendliness toward Japan.

660
00:42:16,619 --> 00:42:18,880
Do you know

661
00:42:19,480 --> 00:42:20,940
the name of this painting?

662
00:42:22,820 --> 00:42:26,519
This is called The Honnoji Incident.

663
00:42:27,719 --> 00:42:30,960
Oda Nobunaga was driven to a dead end

664
00:42:31,440 --> 00:42:32,960
and ultimately took his own life.

665
00:42:32,960 --> 00:42:34,739
His body was never found.

666
00:42:36,219 --> 00:42:38,360
This painting represents Japan at that time,

667
00:42:38,360 --> 00:42:40,340
an empire on the verge of collapse.

668
00:42:41,940 --> 00:42:43,599
If this news gets out,

669
00:42:44,199 --> 00:42:45,699
it will only make

670
00:42:46,480 --> 00:42:47,900
the whole empire a laughingstock.

671
00:42:49,400 --> 00:42:50,460
So we've been

672
00:42:51,400 --> 00:42:52,559
wasting time

673
00:42:52,559 --> 00:42:53,719
with this bastard

674
00:42:53,719 --> 00:42:54,960
all along.

675
00:42:55,840 --> 00:42:59,179
This man won't be controlled at all.

676
00:43:00,960 --> 00:43:03,679
Our plans for China

677
00:43:04,059 --> 00:43:06,440
are by no means a matter of a single day.

678
00:43:07,719 --> 00:43:10,440
China is a giant whale.

679
00:43:11,679 --> 00:43:13,800
It can only be eaten after being divided.

680
00:43:14,219 --> 00:43:17,579
It absolutely cannot be swallowed in one bite.

681
00:43:22,019 --> 00:43:23,699
Extra! Extra!

682
00:43:23,699 --> 00:43:25,460
Breaking news! Breaking news!

683
00:43:25,460 --> 00:43:26,840
Extra! Extra!

684
00:43:26,840 --> 00:43:27,900
Breaking news!

685
00:43:28,199 --> 00:43:29,500
Yu Changxuan colludes with the Japanese!

686
00:43:29,739 --> 00:43:30,920
Today's front-page headline.

687
00:43:31,860 --> 00:43:32,900
How could he do such a thing?

688
00:43:32,900 --> 00:43:34,159
This is absurd.

689
00:43:35,119 --> 00:43:36,219
Look at this Young Yu!

690
00:43:36,400 --> 00:43:37,599
As the leader of the Yu army,

691
00:43:37,619 --> 00:43:38,900
he actually colludes with the Japanese.

692
00:43:39,119 --> 00:43:40,039
How could he do this?

693
00:43:40,079 --> 00:43:40,900
How could he?

694
00:43:41,199 --> 00:43:42,519
But this is the Japanese military.

695
00:43:43,360 --> 00:43:44,159
A general in the army,

696
00:43:44,159 --> 00:43:46,320
openly in league with the Japanese army.

697
00:43:47,500 --> 00:43:48,980
It's treacherous to our country!

698
00:43:49,099 --> 00:43:52,000
Fight to the end! Down with the traitors!

699
00:43:52,300 --> 00:43:55,039
Fight to the end! Down with the traitors!

700
00:43:55,159 --> 00:43:56,300
Traitors

701
00:43:56,440 --> 00:43:57,860
deserve death!

702
00:43:58,039 --> 00:43:59,400
Fight to the end!

703
00:43:59,659 --> 00:44:02,000
Down with the traitors!

704
00:44:02,179 --> 00:44:03,539
They deserve death!

705
00:44:03,639 --> 00:44:05,719
Down with the traitor!

706
00:44:05,840 --> 00:44:07,500
They deserve death!

707
00:44:09,739 --> 00:44:11,099
They deserve death!

708
00:44:12,119 --> 00:44:13,519
Back off! Back off!

709
00:44:13,519 --> 00:44:14,840
Down with the traitors!

710
00:44:16,460 --> 00:44:17,179
Stop shouting!

711
00:44:28,639 --> 00:44:30,380
Did you hear what they're shouting?

712
00:44:32,139 --> 00:44:33,420
It's the same in the army.

713
00:44:34,559 --> 00:44:36,000
They're all asking me what's going on.

714
00:44:37,960 --> 00:44:39,460
I need an explanation.

715
00:44:39,699 --> 00:44:41,000
When I met the man,

716
00:44:41,300 --> 00:44:42,739
he called himself Fujiwara Ko.

717
00:44:43,280 --> 00:44:44,320
I had no idea

718
00:44:44,320 --> 00:44:44,860
he was

719
00:44:44,860 --> 00:44:47,000
a Japanese military man, Kuraida Ichiro.

720
00:44:47,219 --> 00:44:48,139
And we were only

721
00:44:48,139 --> 00:44:49,219
doing a business deal,

722
00:44:49,860 --> 00:44:51,280
opening the port

723
00:44:51,579 --> 00:44:52,599
to transport cotton yarn.

724
00:44:53,559 --> 00:44:54,500
That's all.

725
00:44:54,880 --> 00:44:55,780
For no good reason,

726
00:44:55,780 --> 00:44:56,659
what cotton yarn business

727
00:44:56,659 --> 00:44:57,940
do you have with the Japanese?

728
00:45:01,820 --> 00:45:03,380
You think I don't know?

729
00:45:05,139 --> 00:45:06,179
A few days ago,

730
00:45:06,760 --> 00:45:08,019
you rescued that Ye Pingjun

731
00:45:08,019 --> 00:45:09,699
from Takahashi's hands.

732
00:45:10,400 --> 00:45:11,400
Tell me the truth.

733
00:45:11,900 --> 00:45:13,219
Was it because of her?

734
00:45:16,679 --> 00:45:17,360
Speak.

735
00:45:20,639 --> 00:45:21,420
Changxuan.

736
00:45:24,380 --> 00:45:25,280
A few days ago,

737
00:45:27,199 --> 00:45:28,500
you showed me

738
00:45:28,500 --> 00:45:29,699
your calmness

739
00:45:30,820 --> 00:45:31,500
and rationality.

740
00:45:32,119 --> 00:45:33,260
But now,

741
00:45:33,739 --> 00:45:35,280
for a woman,

742
00:45:35,639 --> 00:45:37,320
you're willing to destroy your own future

743
00:45:37,860 --> 00:45:39,800
and drag the reputation of the Yu army

744
00:45:40,480 --> 00:45:41,940
through the mud?

745
00:45:43,920 --> 00:45:44,960
In your eyes,

746
00:45:46,400 --> 00:45:47,360
you've long since decided

747
00:45:47,360 --> 00:45:48,179
I'm this kind of man,

748
00:45:48,699 --> 00:45:49,300
