752
00:46:02,099 --> 00:46:03,360
Can I still trust you?

753
00:46:06,699 --> 00:46:08,059
If you want to convict me,

754
00:46:09,420 --> 00:46:10,380
I have nothing to say.

755
00:46:21,840 --> 00:46:22,900
No matter what,

756
00:46:23,719 --> 00:46:25,599
you traded with the Japanese

757
00:46:25,760 --> 00:46:28,239
without reporting to the army.

758
00:46:28,699 --> 00:46:29,960
By any standard,

759
00:46:30,500 --> 00:46:31,659
I must punish you severely.

760
00:46:33,920 --> 00:46:34,500
Go.

761
00:46:35,780 --> 00:46:37,380
Report for the fifty strokes with the cane.

762
00:46:45,840 --> 00:46:46,639
Go.

763
00:47:07,159 --> 00:47:07,699
General

764
00:47:07,699 --> 00:47:08,900
really did this?

765
00:47:09,179 --> 00:47:10,159
Right now the common people

766
00:47:10,159 --> 00:47:11,380
hate the Japanese most.

767
00:47:16,460 --> 00:47:17,800
Everyone hates the Japanese now.

768
00:47:23,079 --> 00:47:23,840
After verification,

769
00:47:24,079 --> 00:47:24,960
General Yu

770
00:47:25,880 --> 00:47:27,039
privately reached a trade agreement

771
00:47:27,300 --> 00:47:29,780
