773
00:47:32,039 --> 00:47:33,320
Fifty military canes.

774
00:47:34,860 --> 00:47:35,760
Execute immediately.

775
00:47:59,119 --> 00:48:01,099
This time the Commander is really going all out.

776
00:48:01,159 --> 00:48:01,940
Yes.

777
00:48:02,119 --> 00:48:03,019
Young Master really

778
00:48:03,019 --> 00:48:03,860
went too far this time.

779
00:48:04,239 --> 00:48:05,739
This Kuraida Ichiro has a terrible record.

780
00:48:06,000 --> 00:48:07,800
His hands are stained with the blood of Chinese people.
